The exact native Qwen3.5 decoder layers, vision tower, processor and
tokenizer are imported from Transformers 5; no Transformers modeling source
is copied. The port adds only the fixed-count Loop execution plan, per-visit
cache slots and the mHC residual-stream routers.

This distribution contains no trained model weights. Adaptive loop counts
(`loop_gate`) are not implemented, matching the fixed-count upstream model.
